name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "a6367e8c-4448-42fb-ad9c-17f623634974", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\adars\\Documents\\Projects\\agenticAI\\2.AgentFrameworks\\09_llamaindex_ingestion\\data\\compliance_policy.md", "file_name": "compliance_policy.md", "file_size": 501, "creation_date": "2026-10-20", "last_modified_date": "2026-10-20"}, "hash": "69fe4f3f489390bb7be9fa1e53ee972217a5777f7c85f88825f504818992754c", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "# Enterprise Compliance & Retention Policy\r\n\r\n## Section 1: Customer Data Isolation\r\nCustomer PII must be encrypted at rest using AES-256 and in transit using TLS 1.3.\r\nMulti-tenant databases must enforce tenant ID row-level security (RLS) on all read and write queries.\r\n\r\n## Section 2: Disaster Recovery Objectives\r\nThe Recovery Point Objective (RPO) is strictly 0 seconds for financial ledger data.\r\nThe Recovery Time Objective (RTO) for mission-critical payment services is less than 60 seconds.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 499, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "7554099c-1b35-49aa-b8ec-28b27315e90a": {"__data__": {"id_": "7554099c-1b35-49aa-b8ec-28b27315e90a", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\adars\\Documents\\Projects\\agenticAI\\2.AgentFrameworks\\09_llamaindex_ingestion\\data\\system_architecture.txt", "file_name": "system_architecture.txt", "file_type": "text/plain", "file_size": 385, "creation_date": "2026-10-20", "last_modified_date": "2026-10-20"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "1229609c-7dcb-4a08-b6ef-706028ca9b01", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "C:\\Users\\adars\\Documents\\Projects\\agenticAI\\2.AgentFrameworks\\09_llamaindex_ingestion\\data\\system_architecture.txt", "file_name": "system_architecture.txt", "file_type": "text/plain", "file_size": 385, "creation_date": "2026-10-20", "last_modified_date": "2026-10-20"}, "hash": "9fe06ecbfa80ddb5df72d69b5d50a76c43cd3c5993cfc9e814ae19a833294c43", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "The Core Banking System (CBS) processes real-time ledger updates across 500 branches.\r\nHigh-frequency transactions route through Kafka event streams into a distributed Cassandra cluster.\r\nAll ledger mutations require two-phase commit validation to prevent double-spending anomalies.\r\nAudit logs are asynchronously written to immutable S3 buckets with Object Lock enabled for 7 years.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 383, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}}}